# General Guidelines

- Always answer questions directly first
- Use actual workspace paths in docs, scripts, and examples; do not use placeholder paths like `/path/to/project`
- Never make code changes without explicit user request
- Comment and documentation rules live in `documentation-standards.mdc`

## Solution Structure

Projects live at the repo root, one per layer:

| Project | Role |
|---------|------|
| `NTierTemplate/` | Domain models, domain services, repository interfaces |
| `NTierTemplate.Data/` | EF entities, DbContext, repository implementations, Identity persistence |
| `NTierTemplate.Api/` | ASP.NET Core HTTP API |
| `NTierTemplate.Cli/` | Command-line entry points |
| `NTierTemplate.Web/` | Angular client |

Within each project, organize by **domain**, not technical folders (`controllers/`, `services/`, `views/`, etc.).
